    {
      "text": "The shell seems to be filled with joy. It is said that it will share good luck when treated kindly.",
      "version": "gold"
    },
    {
      "text": "A proverb claims that happiness will come to any one who can make a sleeping TOGEPI stand up.",
      "version": "silver"
    },
    {
      "text": "It is considered to be a symbol of good luck. Its shell is said to be filled with happiness.",
      "version": "crystal"
    },
